c3 :: #system_library "c";
app_auto_sync :: (app: *InnerBreeze) -> s32 #foreign c3;
// A habit's day screen. Habits draws it (apps/habits/habit_day_view.zi): the
// day's entries, the practice sessions linked to it and a counting habit's
// count. The host gives the day's entries and sessions, keeps the round
// being changed, and deletes, saves or steps what the page asks for.
